Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會變得更加堅強的 像你一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活著…就會失去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.77,0:02:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介回來囉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.39,0:02:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這一刻終於來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.48,0:02:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去哪兒?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:38.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介…回來了?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:54.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…大半夜的?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:15.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別打了 別打了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:16.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫停
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.49,0:03:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不要停!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.50,0:03:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:27.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才還在那打瞌睡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰去掐下架啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:32.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼不去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.23,0:03:47.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到此為止!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:03:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別再打了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,省省吧 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別擋我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 你靠邊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.23,0:04:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離遠點 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:09.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不如這樣 定個規則
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:12.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雙方都空手的話 真人優勢太大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相對的 拿著竹刀的謙吾又太強
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:23.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼都行 大家隨手扔點武器給他們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:25.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越沒用的東西越好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:30.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你倆抓到什麼就用什麼做武器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.89,0:04:33.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,憑什麼你來定規則
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.32,0:04:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同感
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.27,0:04:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是只屬於我和真人的決鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:40.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放馬過來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:41.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正有此意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.71,0:04:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:06.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要緊吧 真人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少操心 謙吾那小子也掛綵了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:12.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他沒掛綵我才比較省心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在恭介又把自己關在寢室裡不出來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:19.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,累倒了在睡覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:22.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說他是徒步從東京花了一整晚走回來的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從東京?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他找工作順不順利呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.23,0:05:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:29.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你胳膊怎麼搞的?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:35.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骨頭上似乎出現裂痕了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.17,0:05:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如我所言 我也讓他掛綵了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真人…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這樣竹刀都握不住吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:46.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新人戰就快召開了不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.99,0:05:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會出賽了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真人 看你幹的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:55.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 別在意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該在意的是你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:06:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我對這個白癡害我沒法出賽這點也表示遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.05,0:06:03.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提點有趣的遊戲讓我打發下時間吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.59,0:06:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的遊戲?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 能大家一起玩的有趣遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如將棋或者圍棋?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.89,0:06:20.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 要刺激點的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:22.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 時間夠嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 我該去接她了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.97,0:06:26.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也真夠嗆的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不在乎的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知從何時起 鈴變了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棗同學…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.02,0:06:52.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:56.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要去可怕的地方 我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:07:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦 是直枝君來接你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以來辛苦你了 幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棗同學都不跟直枝君以外的人講話的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.33,0:07:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:17.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴 去我們寢室吃早飯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶 鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次試著和謙吾還有真人一起吃個飯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就和從前一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始懼怕他人的鈴 無法和我們一起上課了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:55.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個是這樣折的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:07:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,折好了 你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:09.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變樣了的 不止鈴一個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.79,0:08:18.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介 你在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在睡覺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:25.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.35,0:08:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:37.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在角落裡…幹嘛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.47,0:08:40.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶 鈴為什麼會變成那樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前說過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴小時候被一群大人按住過 當時她怕極了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和這個有關嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴現在只在和小孩子們一起時才會笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.61,0:09:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有個能笑出來的地方 不是挺好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.39,0:09:19.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那丫頭啊 本來就那麼怯弱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那種如果沒有我一個朋友也交不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.03,0:09:28.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怯弱的嬌氣包
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:30.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才沒這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我問你 除了你 真人和謙吾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴還有朋友嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:41.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她現在就正和朋友們一起笑著吧 這不挺好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:47.99,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs21}你真的從一切中解脫出來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正看到高潮部分 能別打擾我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴身上發生了我不知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:09:58.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而恭介知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才連你也變得這麼陰鬱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要的答案 這個世界裡沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:24.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:32.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴動不動就給真人來一記飛踢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:34.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾專注劍道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介則拉我們一起進行那些激動人心的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.67,0:10:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明這些才是我們的常態
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們孩提時自稱為Little Busters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.12,0:11:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們四人出現在了失去雙親封閉內心的我面前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:07.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩樂天才恭介牽著我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所到之處 無不是快樂鄉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們難道已經變不回從前了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.20,0:11:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有我能做到的任何能助我們變回從前的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那會是什麼事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.36,0:11:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棒球?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.57,0:11:49.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棒球社明明休社了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.37,0:11:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然覺得好懷念
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:11:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棒球也就小時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.15,0:12:05.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打過幾次而已啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.24,0:12:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶 謙吾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們和鈴還有恭介五個人以前總在這裡一起玩對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打過撲克 下過棋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:36.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介把自己關進寢室後
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎連課都沒去上過
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:41.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別管恭介了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.93,0:12:46.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的你能做的只有陪在鈴左右
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是鈴為什麼唯獨不怕我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明連真人和謙吾都不讓接近
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個嘛 理樹 我覺得是因為愛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會吧 哪有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:03.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴內心應該還記得吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…曾經對你的戀慕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:08.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,記得?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不談這個 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了我說的話了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼話?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:17.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說過請你幫忙想點別的事做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:20.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能大家一起玩的有趣遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:22.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 這個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你醞釀一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.10,0:13:33.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能大家一起玩的有趣遊戲啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:39.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事總是恭介來想的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 確實有件事能幫我們變回從前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要…要去哪兒?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:14:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在起我要嘗試一下當初恭介扮演的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:04.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起做些有趣的事 讓夥伴們團結起來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.23,0:14:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 恭介把內向的鈴拉了出來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要重複他做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓鈴躍動起來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.81,0:14:45.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好難啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟我不是恭介那種玩樂天才
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼才能讓鈴笑出來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:55.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列儂…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是昨天那顆棒球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.23,0:15:03.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴 要玩玩看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.37,0:15:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.39,0:15:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:28.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是從休社中的棒球社的話…借一下也沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:29.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:34.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用這個幹嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投接球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.27,0:15:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全力扔過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:50.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲…厲害啊 鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.89,0:15:52.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害的暴投啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還是暴露漢子本性的高速球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:58.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能…再投一次嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:15:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全無法想像這是你第一次玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:11.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不可思議
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.57,0:16:24.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴明明對棒球毫無興趣來著
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.87,0:16:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也這麼覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.77,0:16:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以前玩過投接球嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小時候和恭介玩過之類的?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.65,0:16:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是和恭介
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.81,0:16:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是和理樹玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.96,0:16:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.57,0:16:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼時候?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:42.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不記得了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…更不可思議了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:49.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 這個世界謎團重重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.41,0:17:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後啊 鈴久違地笑了出來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.23,0:17:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個鈴居然如此賣力地投球
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.55,0:17:09.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不可思議吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:12.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴還說「這是世界之謎」呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.62,0:17:18.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在打算去叫大家一起玩投接球
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:22.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介你…也來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.65,0:17:24.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你覺得我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還會對這種事感興趣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.59,0:17:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起讓鈴重拾笑顏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.90,0:17:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像小時候恭介對我做的那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.50,0:17:55.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨時歡迎你來 就當換個心情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:17:59.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:19.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:24.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得搞成比賽形式或許會更有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就邀了大家一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:28.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.87,0:18:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唷 鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:33.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.43,0:18:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去 去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.23,0:18:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真人你來擊個球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:48.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是要幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:52.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想到能大家一起玩的有趣遊戲了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.06,0:18:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是打棒球
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.84,0:18:56.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼打
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:19:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是…因為有趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我就此離隊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.97,0:19:10.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.12,0:19:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 明明是謙吾提議大家一起玩的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.17,0:19:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.55,0:19:21.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這你是無法理解的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:23.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴我原因啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.81,0:19:24.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重合了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你現在的行動…和他的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.95,0:19:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.66,0:19:33.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道恭介也選擇了打棒球?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.03,0:19:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶 真人 你們在隱瞞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.79,0:19:54.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟發生了什麼我還不知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:59.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然瞞著你 當然是不想被你知道的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真人也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.23,0:20:07.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒙在鼓裡的大概只有我和鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.43,0:20:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不知道是什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.68,0:20:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也無法感知 不過恭介的確曾試圖帶我們打棒球
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.57,0:20:24.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後導致鈴開始懼怕他人 恭介則遠離了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.09,0:20:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生了什麼…恭介說答案這個世界裡沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.43,0:20:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那難道答案在其他世界裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.47,0:20:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 既然你走到了這一步 那就夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.27,0:20:44.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來只剩我了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你指什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿著
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.65,0:20:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也離隊了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.73,0:20:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之後就交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.18,0:21:00.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連真人也…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:03.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不玩了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…投接球
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.91,0:21:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.33,0:21:15.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡有個只有我和鈴不知道的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必須揭開這個世界的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:31.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這股強烈的意願…究竟是從哪裡湧出來的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只覺得它從內心深處 噴湧而出
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.99,0:21:42.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴 你聽好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要成為領隊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.81,0:21:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像以前的恭介那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.74,0:21:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去召集夥伴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.23,0:21:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目標是重組Little Busters!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.17,0:23:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必須戰勝你最強的友人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.86,0:23:39.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 最強的證明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:04.62,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}ひとりじゃ寂しい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:10.93,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}だから手を繋いだんだっけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.83,0:01:21.91,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}それじゃいつまでも 子供のままだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.13,0:01:29.64,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}どうしても伝えたかったんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:35.71,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}繋いだ手はもう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:42.29,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}ばらばらになる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.52,0:01:46.08,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}ひとつずつ消えてゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.20,0:01:52.76,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}目覚める日へ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:02:02.39,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}とっとと走っていけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:17.13,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}祭りのあとのようで 寂しいだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:04.62,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}一個人太孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:10.93,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}才會牽起彼此的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.83,0:01:21.91,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}但這樣只會讓人無法成長
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.13,0:01:29.64,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}無論如何我都要告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:35.71,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}牽起的手就要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:42.29,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}四散分離
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.52,0:01:46.08,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}逐一消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.20,0:01:52.76,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}向著夢醒之日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:02:02.39,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}大步向前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:17.13,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}恰如曲終人散時 空剩寂寥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.06,0:22:19.55,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}我們沒能守護住
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.55,0:22:23.14,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}遺失的珍貴之物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.14,0:22:26.67,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}祈禱著有朝一日
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.67,0:22:30.27,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}笑容背後的陰鬱會被照亮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.27,0:22:33.83,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}時光的流逝 今日的結束
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.83,0:22:37.55,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}也理所當然地到來了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.55,0:22:41.01,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}一邊說著「再見」一邊目送你離去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.01,0:22:44.71,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}心中卻深知再也沒有「再見」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.85,0:22:48.05,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}人生地疏的小鎮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.47,0:22:51.80,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}我們在此相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.02,0:22:58.93,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}不知何時 微風在身邊刮起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:04.33,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}但我並不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.33,0:23:07.99,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}我只能盡力去傳達
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.37,0:23:14.55,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}每當迷茫 困惑 受傷之時
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.79,0:23:18.66,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}雙手之間滿載的記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.66,0:23:23.62,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}朝向指尖微微流淌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.62,0:23:28.97,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}請緊緊握住那雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.06,0:22:19.55,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}なくしたもの　大切なこと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.55,0:22:23.14,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}守れなかった僕らの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.14,0:22:26.67,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}笑顔の影　この先いつか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.67,0:22:30.27,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}晴れること祈ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.27,0:22:33.83,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}時間は過ぎ　今日の終りは
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.83,0:22:37.55,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}当たり前にやってくる
